      "sid": "s17",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "👉@CommerceGov is committed to robust and stringent enforcement of US export controls in every corner of the world.  https://t.co/WsO9s2V9IG",
      "date": "2023-04-20",
      "date_quote": "2023-04-20T12:52:50.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Don Graves. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/DepSecGraves/status/1649033380720422913",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "official_role",
        "speaker": "Don Graves",
        "basis": "verified_x_account",
        "account": "DepSecGraves",
        "user_id": "1392831444616101888",
        "organization_id": "commerce",
        "role": "Deputy Secretary of Commerce"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
      "source_text_sha256": "6695e403093eba79c25d001957c7957278696f9248a1eaac07145f0fc782cbed",
      "origin": "federal_x",
      "post_id": "1649033380720422913",
      "account_source_url": "https://www.commerce.gov/news/press-releases/2021/05/don-graves-sworn-deputy-secretary-commerce",
      "excerpted": false,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "98b8a1d945ec4ee4e4f5e2d44d640ab884f12ecbffdfdeba6a37bd408da18754",
      "sid": "s18",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "war. And we’ve been doing just that by leading our partners and allies in imposing export controls that are having a real impact against Russia.",
      "date": "2023-04-13",
      "date_quote": "2023-04-13T20:45:52.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Don Graves. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/DepSecGraves/status/1646615710309974016",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "official_role",
        "speaker": "Don Graves",
        "basis": "verified_x_account",
        "account": "DepSecGraves",
        "user_id": "1392831444616101888",
        "organization_id": "commerce",
        "role": "Deputy Secretary of Commerce"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
      "source_text_sha256": "5482f300a819e262031e0708b0b997d55d7790e327a57cde30138ea47c440777",
      "origin": "federal_x",
      "post_id": "1646615710309974016",
      "account_source_url": "https://www.commerce.gov/news/press-releases/2021/05/don-graves-sworn-deputy-secretary-commerce",
      "excerpted": true,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "98b8a1d945ec4ee4e4f5e2d44d640ab884f12ecbffdfdeba6a37bd408da18754",
      "sid": "s19",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Biden-Harris administration, along with our partners and allies, will continue to degrade Russia’s military and defense industrial base using export controls. https://t.co/ouTYwz2PVh",
      "date": "2023-04-12",
      "date_quote": "2023-04-12T20:19:12.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Don Graves. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/DepSecGraves/status/1646246611365036032",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "official_role",
        "speaker": "Don Graves",
        "basis": "verified_x_account",
        "account": "DepSecGraves",
        "user_id": "1392831444616101888",
        "organization_id": "commerce",
        "role": "Deputy Secretary of Commerce"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
      "source_text_sha256": "be008ca306a8f34d10b5ff0ef3f7d9404b234f5c9a81df6cf880947fefbc8d4a",
      "origin": "federal_x",
      "post_id": "1646246611365036032",
      "account_source_url": "https://www.commerce.gov/news/press-releases/2021/05/don-graves-sworn-deputy-secretary-commerce",
      "excerpted": false,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "98b8a1d945ec4ee4e4f5e2d44d640ab884f12ecbffdfdeba6a37bd408da18754",
      "sid": "s20",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "Export controls work to protect American national security and, when aligned with our allies, amplify our impact during war.",
      "date": "2023-04-05",
      "date_quote": "2023-04-05T14:29:01.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Don Graves. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/DepSecGraves/status/1643621768941166593",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "official_role",
        "speaker": "Don Graves",
        "basis": "verified_x_account",
        "account": "DepSecGraves",
        "user_id": "1392831444616101888",
        "organization_id": "commerce",
        "role": "Deputy Secretary of Commerce"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
      "source_text_sha256": "aef28e6f319c1ce0650529bd96321875b68e23e8f94cf02a7eaa7b474d783d07",
      "origin": "federal_x",
      "post_id": "1643621768941166593",
      "account_source_url": "https://www.commerce.gov/news/press-releases/2021/05/don-graves-sworn-deputy-secretary-commerce",
      "excerpted": false,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "98b8a1d945ec4ee4e4f5e2d44d640ab884f12ecbffdfdeba6a37bd408da18754",
      "sid": "s21",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enforcing our export controls is a crucial part of protecting American national security. We are committed to using all of the tools at our disposal",
      "date": "2023-03-23",
      "date_quote": "2023-03-23T19:11:45.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Don Graves. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/DepSecGraves/status/1638981881042706433",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "official_role",
        "speaker": "Don Graves",
        "basis": "verified_x_account",
        "account": "DepSecGraves",
        "user_id": "1392831444616101888",
        "organization_id": "commerce",
        "role": "Deputy Secretary of Commerce"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
