        "role": "Deputy Secretary of Commerce"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
      "source_text_sha256": "b81963773c09fc3e3ccfff74ab93491efd4a868de28abcb11354ff8d2a0ef174",
      "origin": "federal_x",
      "post_id": "1626342839394385921",
      "account_source_url": "https://www.commerce.gov/news/press-releases/2021/05/don-graves-sworn-deputy-secretary-commerce",
      "excerpted": true,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "98b8a1d945ec4ee4e4f5e2d44d640ab884f12ecbffdfdeba6a37bd408da18754",
      "sid": "s28",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "to this effort have been the unprecedented export controls we put in place at the Department of Commerce.  \n\nRead more in my op-ed here:\nhttps://t.co/5he7pq8tzS",
      "date": "2023-02-01",
      "date_quote": "2023-02-01T17:31:46.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Don Graves. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/DepSecGraves/status/1620837322400075779",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "official_role",
        "speaker": "Don Graves",
        "basis": "verified_x_account",
        "account": "DepSecGraves",
        "user_id": "1392831444616101888",
        "organization_id": "commerce",
        "role": "Deputy Secretary of Commerce"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
      "source_text_sha256": "81e253501cdcdeef74524ac725c17de8d671aa0a7ae9a7876147bba17637914c",
      "origin": "federal_x",
      "post_id": "1620837322400075779",
      "account_source_url": "https://www.commerce.gov/news/press-releases/2021/05/don-graves-sworn-deputy-secretary-commerce",
      "excerpted": true,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "98b8a1d945ec4ee4e4f5e2d44d640ab884f12ecbffdfdeba6a37bd408da18754",
      "sid": "s29",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "It should accelerate AI innovation and growth while advancing — rather than restricting or damaging — civil rights, civil liberties and equity for all.",
      "date": "2023-01-27",
      "date_quote": "2023-01-27T20:19:30.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Don Graves. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/DepSecGraves/status/1619067595856183296",
