      "origin": "federal_x",
      "post_id": "1619067595856183296",
      "account_source_url": "https://www.commerce.gov/news/press-releases/2021/05/don-graves-sworn-deputy-secretary-commerce",
      "excerpted": false,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "98b8a1d945ec4ee4e4f5e2d44d640ab884f12ecbffdfdeba6a37bd408da18754",
      "sid": "s30",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "will help develop and deploy AI technologies in ways that enable the United States, other nations and organizations to enhance AI trustworthiness while managing risks",
      "date": "2023-01-27",
